// title: Near real time (NRT) custom DefenderXDR detection & isolation for Windows Whatsapp security risk
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceFileEvents
// purpose: Near real time (NRT) custom DefenderXDR detection & isolation for Windows Whatsapp security risk
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/Near%20real-time%20(NRT)%20custom%20DefenderXDR%20detection%20&%20isolation%20for%20Windows%20Whatsapp%20security%20risk.kql
